==Overview==
The '''Small Magnet Scientist Toilet''' is a new type of enemy, first appearing in the clock event. It '''stuns''' units by jumping on to them, the same way a '''Parasite Toilet''' does. It is an annoying enemy, having a good amount of HP while being able to stun. However it can be beaten easily by using an '''unstunning''' '''unit''' or a unit which can '''block stuns ('''Upgraded Titan Cinemaman, Upgraded Titan Cameraman etc..)
